  "answer": "This request has been filed before. PowerToys#22361 is the main open request to bring back Cascade Windows. #31506 and #29133 were closed as duplicates of #22361 and #12305, so the request is already tracked. PowerToys has no Cascade Windows feature yet, and the past tickets show no commitment or timeline for one. Add your use case to #22361. That means cascading only the windows of one app and keeping title bars visible. Also give it a thumbs-up. In the meantime, the workaround other users describe is a custom FancyZones layout of overlapping, offset zones. Snapping a window into one of those zones gives a cascade-like arrangement. #12305 is a related request about cascading an app's windows into a FancyZones zone."
 },
